                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.01 Foreign Control/184: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Geneva (Gilbert) to the Secretary of
                            State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1932-01-11T13:00:00+01:00">January 11, 1932—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received January 11—1 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>9. From Reber. Arrived this morning.
                    Committee meeting postponed until January 25th.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Gilbert</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
